OL,3,GNEWSAPaul Scholes banned from driving
OL,4,Afor speeding
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Manchester United footballer
OL,7,FPaul Scholes has been handed a
OL,8,Fsix-month road ban after he racked up
OL,9,Ftwo driving convictions in the space of
OL,10,Ftwo days.
OL,12,FThe 51-year-old was caught speeding in
OL,13,Fa Range Rover on the evening of 3 March
OL,14,Fwhile on a late-night drive through
OL,15,FCleckheaton in West Yorkshire.
OL,17,FIn the second case, Scholes's Mercedes
OL,18,Fbroke the speed limit on Mossley Road
OL,19,Fnear Ashton-under-Lyne, Greater
OL,20,FManchester, on the morning of 14
OL,21,FNovember last year.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
