OL,3,GNEWSAPaul Scholes banned from driving
OL,4,Afor speeding
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 12 August at Bradford Magistrates'
OL,7,FCourt, he was handed a six-month
OL,8,Fdriving ban for the first offence,
OL,9,Falong with fines. The next day at
OL,10,FManchester Magistrates' Court he
OL,11,Freceived six penalty points on his
OL,12,Flicence, and further fines.
